<p>NOTE: * Per share data for 1996 was calculated on a pro forma basis assuming the total number of common shares outstanding subsequent to the Company's initial public offering in June 1996 and excluding the preferred dividend requirements.</p>
<p>On June 11, 1997, Pacific Greystone announced plans to merge with Lennar Corp. The new entity will be named Lennar Corp, and will be comprised of the existing homebuilding operations and residential financial service operations of both companies. The deal is expected to close in the second half of 1997.</p>
